<title>ITALY: Olivetti announces four new board members.</title>
<headline>Olivetti announces four new board members.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Troubled Italian information technology group Olivetti said on Friday it had appointed four new members of its board and one extra member of its executive committee.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the new directors included Gerard Worms, chairman of the board of general partners of Rothschild Bank, and Gordon Owen, chairman of telecommunications group Energis and former chairman of Mercury and former group managing director of Cable &amp; Wireless.</p>
</text>
